                <head>No. 54<lb/><hi rendition="#italic">Editorial Note</hi></head>
                <p>On June 1, 1953, Secretary of State Dulles delivered a report on the Near East
                    over radio and television networks. The report is printed in Department of State
                        <hi rendition="#italic">Bulletin</hi>, June 15, 1953, pages 831–835, and is
                    also published as Department of State publication 5088.</p>
            </div>
